            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Average data for the operation of Swiss long distance trains (Intercity, Eurocity, CIS/ICE/TGV, Interregio, and Express trains). The data has been determined top down, by combining the total yearly energy consumption and the yearly tkm-performance of long-distance transportation of the SBB. Particulate emissions due to abrasion of rail tracks, wheels, brakes and overhead contact line is included. Emission of sulphur hexafluoride (SF6) occurring during conversion at traction substations are accounted for. For a first estimate of European long distance trains, the user may change the electricity mix.;
UUID: 6551952a-2a4c-32c1-9f43-460e1232de57</common:generalComment>
